<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Land &amp; General 6-mth net up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Land &amp; General 6-mth net up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  65.34   vs	  51.73</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 13.1    vs	  11.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   460.63   vs	 406.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    80.67   vs	  85.50</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.91   vs  less   4.42</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 7.5    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Land &amp; General Bhd is a property developer and is also involved in the timber business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
